  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "text": "Ngh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "This one's limping! Take him out first!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "text": "Grani! At this rate, we're all gonna be dead meat!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Even if that's the case...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "text": "Quick! Take Carol and go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "text": "I'll only end up slowing you down with this bad leg!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "text": "I'll find a way to meet up with you later! Hurry!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "It's a promise then! Make sure to come get your share of the treasure!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "text": "...Heh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "text": "Just go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "They ran away!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "text": "All right, who wants to play?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "...The sounds of fighting are quieting down.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "But we can't afford to rest yet, Carol. Sorry...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "I'm fine... But, Mister Bob... what about him...?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "He might need some time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Need some time...? Are you saying...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Oww!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Carol! Are you okay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Sorry, I just tripped over this root...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Here, take my hand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "...Thank you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Can you walk?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "...I'm fine, it's just a bruise. As you said, it's best that we keep moving...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Once we cross this forest, we'll reach the foot of Mt. Mortica. We need to find the second cave halfway up the mountain.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "We can only get in through the cave entrance?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Yeah. Once inside, we'll still have to follow some paths in the darkness, but I know the way. The treasure is hidden in the deepest part of the cave.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Mhm. Well, in that case...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Woah?! Was that an explosion going off in the distance...? Th-that can't be good...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Listen closely, there's the sound of screaming as well.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Someone's fighting. It's not over yet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "...Carol, are you scared?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "I'm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "...Yes, I am.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "But in order to protect my village and return peace to these lands... I have to do this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "I see...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "You're really brave.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "text": "Don't worry about it. Anyway, let's keep moving.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
